  "voxel": "0.5 m, as approved in the storyboard",
  "tile": "25 m: ground recall 0.9437 against 0.8518 for 50 m tiles ('tile 50 m'); one plane for the whole crop scores 0.9469 here ('one plane (tile 250 m)'): this ground is flat, the first example street's was not (previous_street), so the tiles stay",
  "ransac_threshold": "0.4 m: 0.2 m misses more of the uneven ground ('RANSAC threshold 0.2 m')",
  "low_prefilter": "without it RANSAC fits roofs and facades in several tiles, which the plausibility check then has to catch ('no low-point pre-filter', tiles_flagged)",
  "low_window": "1.5 m, kept from the first example street (not re-tuned: the sweep is scored against the same AHN classes it would tune on); 'pre-filter window 3 m' here: ground recall 0.9664 against 0.9437, building precision 0.8237 against 0.822",
  "eps": "0.75 m (1.5 voxels): 0.5 m, the voxel size, leaves most voxels as noise and finds no building; 1.0 m glues buildings to trees and building recall collapses ('eps 0.5', 'eps 1.0')",
  "min_points": "6: 5 lets a tree fuse with a building (lower building recall); 10 turns more than half of the voxels into noise ('min_points 5', 'min_points 10')",
  "cluster_min_height": "0.3 m: without it, ground that RANSAC missed links objects together, building precision drops and more AHN ground becomes vegetation ('no near-ground skip')"
